{"resourceIdentifier":"2573","resourceName":"SANTIAGO PONIENTE LANDFILL GAS PROJECT","description":"The proposed project activity has the objective to capture and to flare/use the landfill gas produced in the landfill called - Relleno Sanitario Santiago Poniente, located in the commune of Maipú in Chile.\r\n\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project activity the landfill gas partially burned in the Landfill Gas collection and flaring system.\r\n\r\nThe first phase of the project was the refurbishment to an efficient capture, collection and flaring system to burn CH4 (a greenhouse gas). These actions will reduce odors and adverse environmental impacts.\r\n\r\nDuring the second phase, the project will install generators that will combust the LFG to produce electricity, using part of the electricity for self-consumption at the landfill facilities and the surplus part will be exported to the grid. The flares will be kept in operation due to LFG excess, periods when electricity will not be produced or other operational considerations. The LFG power plant will be expected to install up to 4MW upon project completion. However, the final equipment that will be chosen (as well as the final installed capacity) may vary depending on the availability of the generator equipment in the market at the time of actual implementation of the second phase.","location":{"latitude":33.522919,"longitude":70.867438},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-28","endExclusive":"2021-11-28","endInclusive":"2021-11-27"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2573"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Provincia de Santiago"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Veolia Su Chile S.A"},{"type":"string","value":"Santiago, Chile"},{"type":"string","value":"+56993219082"},{"type":"string","value":"edgar-ricardo.pinzon@veolia.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"260392"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"RINA Services S.p.A"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 14/04/2022 - 13/04/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57326&IDKEY=wiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfk79052554","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Santiago- Poniente-PD v1 13102021.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-10-28T16:35:45.04Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=54378&IDKEY=2kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909274987262","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-08-02T20:19:58.367Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=122597&IDKEY=iiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3q169061263","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"2024 11 07 - RSSP PD_v6_clean_JAS.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-11-18T15:51:48.393Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=107241&IDKEY=miquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfc147885339","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Complete_con_DocuSign_RSSP_Reg